MyBSD Tomoyo Explorer (BSD Explorer) is a classic BSD/Unix graphical
file manager written in Ruby with GTK+ 1.2 and GdkPixbuf by Ariff Abdullah
(skywizard@MyBSD.org.my) for the MyBSD project.

Features include dual-pane/canvas view, bookmarking, filesystem mounting
and usage indicators, file typing, and customizable themes.

WWW: https://github.com/9M2PJU/MyBSD-Tomoyo-Explorer
